# C0 vs Render — Worker Memory (CPD-1021 / CPD-1025)

Read `docs/C0_REPOSITORY_POLICY.md` and the **Worker Memory** block at the top of `STATUS.md` before any git merge or gate/publish work.

**Confluence HOW:** [Server Split — C0/C1+ Boundary](https://aurafluxco.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CP/pages/6881341) — update there first when policy changes.

## Three worlds (do not conflate)

| World | Folder | Branch | Deploys to |
|-------|--------|--------|------------|
| **C0 localhost** | `~/cwn-c0` | `c0/main` | pm2 @ localhost:3000 · GitHub **auraflux-c0** |
| **Render production** | `~/cwn-production` | `main` | Render `auraflux-api` + app · GitHub **auraflux-api** |
| **Jira ticket IDs** | — | — | Git commit tags may be wrong (e.g. `cpd-1017` in commits ≠ Jira CPD-1017) |

## Never

- Merge `origin/main` into the C0 branch to "sync" — cherry-pick portable `lib/` fixes only (CPD ticket each)
- Merge C0 branch → `main` without explicit port ticket (PR #637 class mistake)
- Replace C0 `lib/gates/gate5.js` with a production `portal5.js` shim — C0 uses full gate5 + `/uploadposts/status`
- Delete `lib/gates/gate{1,2,3b}.js` without shims — `assembly.js` still `require('./gates/…')`
- `pm2 restart broadcast-sidecar` during a live RTMP-bypass stream (ends YouTube listing)
- Raw `pm2 restart auraflux` during grid — use `bash scripts/safe_restart.sh`

## C0-only (stay on C0 line)

`cwn_production.html`, `lib/live_grid/*`, broadcast sidecar, full `lib/gates/*`, manual checkpoint workflow, SQLite `data/cwn.db`

## Reviews

- C0: `bash scripts/aider_session_review_local.sh`
- Render: `bash scripts/aider_session_review.sh`

## Commits — C0 repo only (~/cwn-c0 → auraflux-c0)

**Before every commit here**, ask: is this C0-specific (live grid, gates, `cwn_production.html`, sidecar)?

| Work type | Where to commit |
|-----------|-----------------|
| Live grid, broadcast, gates, dashboard HTML | **~/cwn-c0** (`c0/main`) |
| Next.js app, `lib/portals/`, Render deploy, C1+ API | **~/cwn-production** (`main`) |
| Shared `lib/` fix for both | C0 with `C0_PORTABLE=1`, then **cherry-pick** to `main` |

Pre-commit hook (`bash scripts/install_git_hooks.sh`) **blocks** `app/`, `lib/portals/`, `render.yaml`, Postgres migrations, etc. **Warns** when staged code has no C0-native path. Bypass portable ports: `C0_PORTABLE=1 git commit …`

